      "mergedPostDetails": "Since build 1626, when using Pimax and looking slightly to the right, the view is inverted while facing a specific angle.\n\nIt may be difficult to understand, but if you watch the video, you will see that when you look to the right, your viewpoint momentarily shifts and you look backward.\n\nThis is a very critical bug that makes it difficult to play in VR itself.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/arfgCFQcKvk",
